  "intraday_notes": [
    {
      "id": "note-41510ed7afc7",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-09 09:44:00 EDT",
      "text": "開盤TR 大Bull bar突破，收高先不用sell limit",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T08:51:35.885269+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T08:51:35.885282+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-f285c2e406fa",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-09 09:49:00 EDT",
      "text": "變成micro DB BO 多方拿到1R\n等10點小結構反轉",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T08:52:04.822301+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T08:52:57.626049+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-64ed2f55632a",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-09 09:54:00 EDT",
      "text": "這裡超大陰線超過整段50%，可能TR，選擇前高Sell limit\n沒有成交",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T08:53:37.384071+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T08:54:04.215957+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-bd5e5b05727c",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-09 10:04:00 EDT",
      "text": "測試今低\n1. PB後向下BO拿波幅\n2. 10點反轉向上拿波幅\n3. 大TR\n2.3都可以用低點Buy limit",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T08:55:53.068764+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T08:55:53.068775+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-e96f1a43c31c",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-09 10:14:00 EDT",
      "text": "超大陰線BO，收盤離場",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T08:57:22.826427+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T08:57:48.106290+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-23a380e95a77",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-09 10:24:00 EDT",
      "text": "空方拿到大TR BO 1R，認為這邊還是偏空操作有可能\n去拿2倍標準差",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T08:58:53.432984+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T08:58:53.432994+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-5b4003f30868",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-09 10:29:00 EDT",
      "text": "這邊除非向下BO失敗，不然有機會再拿一段TR BO\n拿TR BO 1R + 2R SL位置",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T08:59:36.756545+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T09:00:49.567847+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-ff2e957a8b0f",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-09 10:49:00 EDT",
      "text": "空方BO拿到TR BO 2R\n碰2R大Bear bar直接突破可能往3R、2倍標準差",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T09:02:33.069037+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T09:02:33.069048+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-25bf3dcc67ca",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-09 11:04:00 EDT",
      "text": "差一點碰3R，空方應該會嘗試再測一次低點",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T09:03:07.822903+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T09:03:07.822915+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-d56428784a53",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-09 11:29:00 EDT",
      "text": "這邊第三次BO，拿到TR BO 1R\n連續3次大K線BO有可能Climax\n這裡嘗試Buy the close大SL賭反轉\n1. 拿到MLH 上1/3\n2. 拿到MLH",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T09:04:14.190114+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T09:06:55.445247+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-cd8dc710d4fa",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-09 11:59:00 EDT",
      "text": "關鍵位置實體K線BO,收盤離場",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T09:08:13.105865+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T09:08:13.105873+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-93fb007c08ab",
